# Videos are served from Cloudinary CDN — safe to keep out of the deployment bundle.
public/assets/**/*.mp4

# The @nanda.regine poem archive is served from Cloudinary (poem-wall/* via cldImg),
# NOT local paths, so the heavy HEIC originals don't need to ship. Kept in git as
# the master source; excluded from the Vercel bundle.
public/assets/poem-instagram/**

# NOTE on images: we do NOT exclude *.jpg here. lib/house-assets.ts (the "visual
# atlas") serves many portraits/backgrounds as LOCAL /public paths via PlacedPortrait
# + RoomBackdrop (lineage, sanyu, the poem reader, etc.), so excluding jpgs 404s them.
# Trimming the ~image weight from the deploy requires migrating that atlas to
# Cloudinary <CldImage> (like the Gallery already does) — tracked as follow-up work.
